msgid " (controller port "
msgstr "（控制器端口 "

msgid " — members will not receive an address from this pool."
msgstr " —— 成员将不会从此地址池获得地址。"

msgid "A node address is exactly 10 hex digits"
msgstr "节点地址必须为 10 位十六进制数字"

msgid "A pool needs a route covering the same subnet, otherwise members receive no address."
msgstr "地址池需要一个覆盖相同子网的路由，否则成员将获取不到地址。"

msgid "A ZeroTier controller or moon root must live on a server with a fixed public IP, reachable by SSH, with passwordless sudo for that user. The controller API has no TLS and refuses every non-loopback caller, so this page never talks to it directly: it opens an SSH tunnel from this router to the remote loopback interface and sends API calls through it. The controller authtoken is read over SSH on demand and is never stored here."
msgstr "ZeroTier 控制器或 Moon 根节点必须运行在具有固定公网 IP 的服务器上，可经 SSH 访问，且该用户具有免密 sudo 权限。控制器 API 不支持 TLS 且拒绝所有非本机回环的调用方，因此本页面从不直接访问它：而是从本路由器向远程回环接口建立 SSH 隧道，经隧道发送 API 调用。控制器令牌按需经 SSH 读取，从不存储在本机。"

